Output assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "cd ~/.claude/skills/gh-scout && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

Type `# /gh-scout software for the maritime shipping and logistics industry`
Enter
Sleep 1200ms

Type `# scouting GitHub repos + code search, npm/crates, awesome-lists, Hacker News...`
Enter
Sleep 1800ms

Hide
Type "glow -s pink -w 96 assets/demo-digest.md"
Show
Enter

Sleep 6s
